## Interface: 120105
## Title: Bonus Roll Helper
## Notes: Plan your Nebulous Voidcore bonus rolls: every current-season boss and dungeon loot pool per spec, a wishlist and avoid list, and the odds of each roll. Bonus-roll history is read from the Simulationcraft addon.
## Version: 1.0.0
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Enchant_VoidSphere
## Category: Dungeons & Raids
## OptionalDeps: Simulationcraft
## SavedVariables: BonusRollHelperDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: BonusRollHelperCharDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: BonusRollHelper_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: BonusRollHelper_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: BonusRollHelper_OnAddonCompartmentLeave

Core\Init.lua
Core\Season.lua
Core\Pool.lua
Core\History.lua
Core\Odds.lua

UI\Theme.lua
